    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapstick Bosses is a heavily stylized boss fighting game, with a sole focus on gameplay and comedy. Explore the game's wacky world and all the outlandish humor it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss is completely unique, offering different playstyles throughout. What they do have in common is their 3 difficultys, ranging from challenging yet calm to blood-curdlingly difficult; as well as challenges for each, modified bosses that provide a new way to play each boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss defeat will earn you more of the game's currecy: <strong>Bits</strong>, which can be used to buy a plethora of cosmetics. The harder the difficulty, the more bits you'll earn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics come in the form of heads. Both swappable and stylish, these bad boys are always worth the price.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapstick Bosses is a heavily stylized boss fighting game, with a sole focus on gameplay and comedy. Explore the game's wacky world and all the outlandish humor it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss is completely unique, offering different playstyles throughout. What they do have in common is their 3 difficultys, ranging from challenging yet calm to blood-curdlingly difficult; as well as challenges for each, modified bosses that provide a new way to play each boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss defeat will earn you more of the game's currecy: <strong>Bits</strong>, which can be used to buy a plethora of cosmetics. The harder the difficulty, the more bits you'll earn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics come in the form of heads. Both swappable and stylish, these bad boys are always worth the price.</p>",
    "short_description": "A wacky boss fighting game with a charming and unique style, where the only goal is to beat them all! Collect Bits to unlock cool cosmetics! Can you master each boss on their hardest difficultys?",
